        'el_GR' => '5.2 Who pays customs duties, VAT, and other import taxes follows the ολοκλήρωση αγοράς Incoterm/tax notice (e.g. DDP vs destination collect). If ολοκλήρωση αγοράς does not state the seller pays, the recipient pays as required by local customs by default.',
        'en_GB' => '5.2 Who pays customs duties, VAT, and other import taxes follows the checkout Incoterm/tax notice (e.g. DDP vs destination collect). If checkout does not state the seller pays, the recipient pays as required by local customs by default.',
