    '5.3 收件人应配合提供清关所需资料。因资料不全、拒付税费、超期未清关或收件人弃件导致退运、销毁或滞留的，相关费用（含回程运费、仓储、销毁费等）可能由买家承担，已付商品款项按协商办理退款或重发。' => [
        'ar_SA' => '5.3 يجب على المستلم تقديم مستندات التخليص. تكاليف نقص المستندات أو عدم دفع الرسوم أو تأخر التخليص أو الترك (إعادة الشحن، التخزين، الإتلاف وغيرها) قد يتحملها المشتري؛ والبضاعة المدفوعة تُسترد أو تُعاد شحنها بالاتفاق.',
        'bg_BG' => '5.3 Получатель обязан предоставить документы на оформление. Расходы из‑за неполных документов, неуплаты сборов, просрочки оформления или отказа (обратная доставка, хранение, уничтожение и т. п.) может нести покупатель; оплаченный товар возвращают или пересылают по договорённости.',
        'bn_BD' => '5.3 प्राप्तकर्ता क्लीयरेंस दस्तावेज़ दे। अधूरे दस्तावेज़, कर न चुकाना, समय पर क्लीयर न होना या परित्याग से वापसी/नष्ट/रुकाव की लागत खरीदार पर हो सकती है; चुकाया माल सहमति से रिफंड या पुनः भेजा जाएगा।',
        'ca_ES' => '5.3 El destinatario debe aportar la documentación aduanera. Los costes por documentación incompleta, impuestos impagados, despacho vencido o abandono (vuelta, almacén, destrucción, etc.) pueden correr a cargo del comprador; la mercancía pagada se reembolsa o reenvía de acuerdo.',
        'cs_CZ' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'da_DK' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'de_DE' => '5.3 Empfänger müssen Zollunterlagen bereitstellen. Kosten durch unvollständige Unterlagen, unbezahlte Abgaben, überfällige Abfertigung oder Aufgabe (Rückversand, Lager, Vernichtung usw.) können dem Käufer entstehen; gezahlte Ware wird nach Absprache erstattet oder erneut versandt.',
        'el_GR' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'en_GB' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'en_US' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'es_ES' => '5.3 El destinatario debe aportar la documentación aduanera. Los costes por documentación incompleta, impuestos impagados, despacho vencido o abandono (vuelta, almacén, destrucción, etc.) pueden correr a cargo del comprador; la mercancía pagada se reembolsa o reenvía de acuerdo.',
        'es_MX' => '5.3 El destinatario debe aportar la documentación aduanera. Los costes por documentación incompleta, impuestos impagados, despacho vencido o abandono (vuelta, almacén, destrucción, etc.) pueden correr a cargo del comprador; la mercancía pagada se reembolsa o reenvía de acuerdo.',
        'et_EE' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'fi_FI' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'fr_CA' => '5.3 Le destinataire doit fournir les documents de dédouanement. Les frais liés à des dossiers incomplets, taxes impayées, dédouanement hors délai ou abandon (retour, stockage, destruction, etc.) peuvent être à la charge de l’acheteur ; la marchandise payée est remboursée ou renvoyée d’un commun accord.',
        'fr_FR' => '5.3 Le destinataire doit fournir les documents de dédouanement. Les frais liés à des dossiers incomplets, taxes impayées, dédouanement hors délai ou abandon (retour, stockage, destruction, etc.) peuvent être à la charge de l’acheteur ; la marchandise payée est remboursée ou renvoyée d’un commun accord.',
        'ga_IE' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
