        'hr_HR' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'hu_HU' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
        'id_ID' => '5.3 Penerima harus menyediakan dokumen clearance. Biaya dari dokumen kurang, pajak belum dibayar, clearance terlambat, atau penolakan (ongkir balik, gudang, pemusnahan, dll.) dapat ditanggung pembeli; barang yang sudah dibayar direfund atau dikirim ulang sesuai kesepakatan.',
        'is_IS' => '5.3 Recipients must provide clearance documents. Costs from incomplete documents, unpaid taxes, overdue clearance, or abandonment (return freight, storage, destruction, etc.) may be borne by the buyer; paid merchandise may be refunded or reshipped by agreement.',
